   "content": [
      {
         "id": "SECTION_prerequisites",
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "<p><span id=\"htZoomImageMsg\"></span></p>",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "html",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "### Prerequisites\n\nThis summary brings together the five texts that introduce the ten multiplication tables. Read them in order before continuing:\n\n- **Learning Multiplication Table (0 and 1)**: the rules for multiplying by zero and by one (<htcite0>)\n- **Learning Multiplication Table (2 and 3)**: doubling, tripling, and the first formulas (<htcite1>)\n- **Learning the Multiplication Table (4 and 5)**: squares, rectangles, hands, and counting by fours and fives (<htcite2>)\n- **Learning Multiplication Table (6 and 7)**: flowers, weeks, and counting by sixes and sevens (<htcite3>)\n- **Learning the Multiplication Table (8 and 9)**: octagons, enneagons, and counting by eights and nines (<htcite4>)",
               "source": [
                  {
                     "type": 1,
                     "uuid": "da2e2b37-7b63-4ba8-8ddd-e72535068258",
                     "text": "History Tracers Team",
                     "page": "Learning Multiplication Table (0 and 1)",
                     "date_time": {
                        "type": "gregory",
                        "year": "2026",
                        "month": "-1",
                        "day": "-1"
                     }
                  },
                  {
                     "type": 1,
                     "uuid": "8bbd4fa3-d3cf-4ff4-bd96-65dc852e508b",
                     "text": "History Tracers Team",
                     "page": "Learning Multiplication Table (2 and 3)",
                     "date_time": {
                        "type": "gregory",
                        "year": "2026",
                        "month": "-1",
                        "day": "-1"
                     }
                  },
                  {
                     "type": 1,
                     "uuid": "3bc9800d-aa41-4930-84f4-749eb6e40657",
                     "text": "History Tracers Team",
                     "page": "Learning the Multiplication Table (4 and 5)",
                     "date_time": {
